# We deploy the prebuilt static site only. Ignore everything at the repo root,
# then re-include the built output and this deploy's config.
#
# NOTE: do NOT list bare names like "assets" here — .vercelignore matches at any
# depth, so "assets" would also match dist/assets and drop every bundled image
# and font. The whitelist below avoids that class of bug entirely.
/*
!dist
!vercel.json
